{"case_id": "female_19800921_P007-Q31", "domain": "study", "question": "命主的学历状况如何？", "expected_answer": "C", "predicted_answer": "C", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字分析，丁火日主生于酉月，财星当令，金旺火弱。双乙木印星透干却无根虚浮，且年干庚金合克乙木，形成财星破印之象，主学业易受物质或现实因素干扰，早年读书根基不稳。但1980年出生者，在马来西亚普及教育背景下，完全小学毕业或初中辍学的概率较低。早年行甲申大运，甲木正印透出但坐绝地，印星乏力；青少年时期入癸未大运，未为木库，能暗生乙木印星，且未中藏丁火根气，运势稍有助益，有继续求学的可能。然原局印星受伤过重，难以支撑高学历，综合判断为中等学历，专科毕业较为贴合命理与现实。\n\n最终答案：C", "correct": true, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "female_19800921_P007-Q31", 1, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\benchmark\\outputs\\phase6_6b1d_r3\\slice_2024_b1a_prime_R1_P1_G3\\details_2024_b1a_prime_R1_P1_G3.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 17585, "response_id": "f651a24a-e3d4-435d-86d8-f5a589fb4350", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 205, "completion_tokens": 969, "total_tokens": 1174, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 780}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 77}}
